# Include Rules

- Engine/Core/pch.h is the global precompiled header.
- Do not include headers already included by pch.h.
- Avoid redundant STL includes.
- Avoid redundant Windows or DirectX includes.
- Only include headers required for symbols not provided by pch.h.
- Keep public headers lightweight.
- Prefer forward declarations when possible.
- Avoid unnecessary transitive includes.
- Never include d3d12.h outside DX12 backend implementation files.
- Never expose DirectX12 types in public headers.
- DirectX12 headers may only exist inside DX12 backend cpp files.
- Keep DirectX includes inside cpp files whenever possible.